  in: ["position fen r3k2r/p1ppqpb1/bn2pnp1/3PN3/1p2P3/2N2Q1p/PPPBBPPP/R3K2R w KQkq - 0 1","go nodes 1"]
  out: ["info depth 1 score cp 166 nodes 602 time 20 nps 30100 pv e2a6","bestmove e2a6"]
